# Optional: Google OAuth Web Client ID (for Sign in with Google on GitHub Pages / localhost).
# Create at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials — OAuth 2.0 Client ID (Web application).
# Authorized JavaScript origins: http://localhost:8765, https://<your-github-user>.github.io
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# Optional: cloud backup for progress, notes, prove links, API keys, regenerations (Google `sub` as key).
# Deploy sync-worker/ to Cloudflare KV or any compatible API (see sync-worker/README.md).
# VITE_STUDIO_SYNC_URL=https://your-worker.example.workers.dev
# Legacy alias (theory-only responses still supported):
# VITE_THEORY_SYNC_URL=https://your-api.example/theory-regenerations
